1
00:00:00,810 --> 00:00:03,540
(Sheldon:)Woo-woo.

2
00:00:08,810 --> 00:00:11,530
(Amy:)Did I tell you our lab got
a grant to study addiction?

3
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:13,570
(Dr. Brian Greene:)No.
Fascinating work.

4
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:17,300
(Amy:)I recently trained a capuchin
monkey to smoke cigarettes.

5
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:19,170
(Sheldon:)Have you learned anything?

6
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:22,640
(Amy:)Yes. He looks much cooler
than the non-smoking monkeys.

7
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:25,780
(Amy:)Although it's not
much of a contest.

8
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:29,420
(Amy:)The other monkeys just
sit around and masturbate.

9
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:37,460
(Sheldon:)If you don't mind, I'd like to stop
listening to you and start talking.

10
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:39,130
(Amy:)By all means.

11
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:41,600
(Sheldon:)Howard has announced
his intention

12
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,760
(Sheldon:)to propose marriage
to Bernadette.

13
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:45,300
(Amy:)I don't understand.

14
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,900
(Amy:)The original piece of gossip
indicated an impending breakup.

15
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,000
(Sheldon:)I know.

16
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:51,540
(Sheldon:)The group consensus
is that his proposal

17
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:55,410
(Sheldon:)will be met with an humiliating,
soul-crushing rejection.

18
00:00:55,410 --> 00:00:58,450
(Sheldon:)Everyone was set a-twitter.

19
00:00:58,450 --> 00:01:03,020
(Sheldon:)Although oddly,
no one tweeted.

